Give the scripts sfall's interface_print and interface_overlay

Text printed onto an interface window as the original's PrintRect does, and an overlay a script can draw on above a window, kept there as the window redraws beneath it (made, cleared, taken away). Fallout Yesterday's stealing mod shows the chance to steal each item that way.
